Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:21:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(dev-loop): harden worktree isolation, base-tree
 leakage guards, and multi-harness concurrency

- Enforce strict worktree isolation and worktree reuse clean/reset
- Implement base tree state snapshotting and gate leakage detection in base-audit CLI
- Add index.lock safe backoff, retry, and stale lock eviction (>45s)
- Support concurrent multi-harness lane execution (Claude Code CLI and Antigravity)
- Add 12-test comprehensive isolation and concurrency test suite
